## Interface: 11509
## Title: Talent Planner
## Version: 5.0.0
## Author: Moregelen, Sveng
## Notes: Shows what order you should spend talent points in. Import from Wowhead, Talent Planner web UI, or JSON. Compatible with Classic Era, Hardcore, and Season of Discovery.
## SavedVariables: TalentPlannerAccountSavedSequences, TalentPlannerAccountCollapsedClasses, TalentPlannerAccountNextSequenceId
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: IsTalentPlannerExpanded, TalentPlannerTalents, TalentPlannerSavedSequences, TalentPlannerActiveSequenceIds
